			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2147773">
									

<p>Slight necro, but that was <em>totally</em> intentional on the Egyptians' part. If I recall correctly, a person can't get into the afterlife if records/proof, including their body and any documents, weren't preserved according to ancient Egyptian culture. Cremation and censorship like that were used as a way to condemn people to purgatory.</p>

